<title>CANADA: Early close planned for Canada bond market today.</title>
<headline>Early close planned for Canada bond market today.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Toronto Bond Traders' Association said on Friday it recommended that dealings in the Canadian bond market end early today at 1500 EST/1900 GMT.</p>
<p>Canadian financial markets are closed on Monday for Canada's Thanksgiving holiday.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
